text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Breeding Pit unless you pay {B}{B}.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, create a 0/1 black Thrull creature token.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Kuro, Pitlord unless you pay {B}{B}{B}{B}.\\nPay 1 life: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Barren Moor enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B}.\\nCycling {B} ({B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Choose one —\\n• Target player gains 3 life.\\n• Prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', 'Choose one —\\n• You draw five cards and you lose 5 life.\\n• Create an X/X black Demon creature token with flying, where X is the number of cards in your hand.\\nEntwine {4} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)', 'Corrupt deals damage to any target equal to the number of Swamps you control. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Discard a card, Sacrifice Overeager Apprentice: Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'Each player sacrifices two creatures.', 'Enchant creature\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a creature.\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has trample.\\nEnchanted creature is a Demon Spirit.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2 as long as it's white. Otherwise, it gets -2/-1.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying and vigilance.', "Enchant permanent\\nWhen Faith's Fetters enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.\\nEnchanted permanent can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated unless they're mana abilities.", 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, you may tap target creature.', "Exile target creature. At the beginning of the next end step, return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.", 'Flying', 'Flying, first strike, vigilance, trample, haste, protection from black and from red', "Flying, trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a creature other than Lord of the Pit. If you can't, Lord of the Pit deals 7 damage to you.", 'Flying, vigilance', "Flying, vigilance\\nWhen Twilight Shepherd enters the battlefield, return to your hand all cards in your graveyard that were put there from the battlefield this turn.\\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Flying\\nDaggerclaw Imp can't block.", "Flying\\nHellbent — Demon's Jester gets +2/+1 as long as you have no cards in hand.", 'Flying\\nSacrifice a creature: Fallen Angel gets +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Angel of Mercy enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Foul Imp enters the battlefield, you lose 2 life.', "Flying\\nWhen Reiver Demon enters the battlefield, if you cast it from your hand, destroy all nonartifact, nonblack creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Flying\\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Angelic Protector becomes the target of a spell or ability, Angelic Protector gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Stinkweed Imp deals combat damage to a creature, destroy that creature.\\nDredge 5 (If you would draw a card, you may mill five cards instead. If you do, return this card from your graveyard to your hand.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever Sustainer of the Realm blocks, it gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a player casts a nonblack spell, that player loses 1 life.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Target player loses 1 life.', 'Marble Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}.', 'Pay 3 life: Put a +1/+1 counter on Souldrinker.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Secluded Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}.\\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Spend only black mana on X.\\nConsume Spirit deals X damage to any target and you gain X life.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'When Abyssal Gatekeeper dies, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Venerable Monk enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'Whenever Charging Paladin attacks, it gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature attacks, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a black spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a white spell, you may gain 1 life.', '{1}{W}{W}: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.']
flavor: ['"Choose your next words carefully. They will be your last."\\n—Phage the Untouchable', '"Don\'t worry. I\'m not going to deprive you of all your secrets. Just your most precious one."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Even in single combat, I am never alone."\\n—Rafiq of the Many', '"Ha, banishment? Be merciful, say \'death,\'\\nFor exile hath more terror in his look,\\nMuch more than death."\\n—William Shakespeare, *Romeo and Juliet*', '"Hope shall be the blade that severs our bonds."', '"If one gets in your chimney, you\'re going to need a long wick and a barrel of bangstuff to get it out."\\n—Hob Heddil', '"In the game of conquest, who cares about the pawns if the king yet reigns?"\\n—Geth, keeper of the Vault', '"Leshrac, my liege, grant me the power I am due."\\n—Lim-Dûl, the Necromancer', '"My family sheltered in her light, the dark was content to wait."\\n—Crovax', '"My summoning begins your debt, planeswalker."', '"The landscape shimmered and I felt a chill breeze. When my vision cleared, I found myself alone among the corpses of my fallen friends."\\n—Journal found in Numai', '"The light of an angel\'s glance is warm, but her fixed stare blinds and burns."\\n—Calexis, deacon of the New Order of Serra', '"The spread of evil\'s destruction shall always be matched by the rise of the noble fallen."', '"There are two ways for me to pass this gate. One involves you remaining conscious."\\n—Gerrard of the *Weatherlight*', '"Until the world unites in vengeful fury and Phage is destroyed, I will not stay my hand."\\n—Akroma, angelic avenger', '"Why do you weep for the dead? I rejoice, for they have died for me."', '"Wrath is no vice when inflicted upon the deserving."', '"You have not died until I consent."', '"Your blood, your marrow, your spirit—all are mine."\\n—Mayvar, minion of Geth', 'Age wears the flesh but galvanizes the soul.', "An angel's blessing prepares a soldier for war better than a thousand military drills.", 'Clash of sword and cry of beast fall mute when angels sound the call to prayer.', "Don't drink and thrive.", "Even those born to battle could only lay their blades at Akroma's feet.", 'Every tear shed is a drop of immortality.', "Grelden knelt and felt the cool, dry hand of the priest on his brow. Hours later, when his wits returned, he was covered in his enemies' blood on the field of victory.", 'Her sword sings more beautifully than any choir.', 'If only every message were as perfect as its bearer.', 'If taken, it cuts the hand that clutches it. If given, it heals the hand that holds it.', 'Imps are just intelligent enough to have an understanding of cruelty.', 'Its curve mimics the twists of life and death.', 'Its laughter drives needles through your mind.', 'Liliana learned the secrets she sought, but at a price that was etched on her fate.', "Slow and steady may not always win the race, but at least it doesn't end up splattered on the walls.", 'Such power grows the body as it shrinks the soul.', 'The Simic use the claws as scalpels, while the Rakdos use them for tattooing and torture. The Gruul use them to pick their teeth after lunching on the rest of the carcass.', 'The imp, unaware of its own odor, paused to catch its breath . . . and promptly died.', 'The thrulls bred at a terrifying pace. In the end, they overwhelmed the Order of the Ebon Hand.', "The touch of Serra's angels bears hopes aloft and empowers noble causes.", 'There are things beneath the murk for whom the bog is a stew, a thin broth in need of meat.', "They knock 'em dead, with or without the punch line.", 'To gaze under its hood is to invite death.', "You may break her shield, but you'll never break her spirit."]
artist: ['Adrian Smith', 'Alan Pollack', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Brian Despain', 'Brom', 'Chippy', 'Ciruelo', 'Clint Langley', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Dave Allsop', 'David Martin', 'Dermot Power', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Heather Hudson', 'Jason Chan', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'John Avon', 'Jon Foster', 'Kev Walker', 'Marc Fishman', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Matt Thompson', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Michael Komarck', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Nils Hamm', 'Paolo Parente', 'Pete Venters', 'Ray Lago', 'Rob Alexander', 'Sal Villagran', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Stephen Tappin', 'Steven Belledin', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
