0', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'WTH', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['Add {B}{B}{B} to your mana pool.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Breeding Pit unless you pay {B}{B}.\\nAt the end of your turn, put a 0/1 black Thrull creature token into play.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Kuro, Pitlord unless you pay {B}{B}{B}{B}.\\nPay 1 life: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'B', 'Barren Moor comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} to your mana pool.\\nCycling {B} ({B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Choose one — Target player gains 3 life; or prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', 'Choose one — You draw five cards and you lose 5 life; or put a black Demon creature token with flying into play with power and toughness each equal to the number of cards in your hand as the token comes into play.\\nEntwine {4} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)', 'Corrupt deals damage equal to the number of Swamps you control to target creature or player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Discard a card, Sacrifice Overeager Apprentice: Add {B}{B}{B} to your mana pool.', 'Each player sacrifices two creatures.', 'Enchant creature\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a creature.\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has trample.\\nEnchanted creature is a Demon Spirit.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2 as long as it's white. Otherwise, it gets -2/-1.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying and vigilance.', "Enchant permanent\\nWhen Faith's Fetters comes into play, you gain 4 life.\\nEnchanted permanent's activated abilities can't be played unless they're mana abilities. If enchanted permanent is a creature, it can't attack or block.", 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, you may tap target creature.', 'Flying', 'Flying, first strike, vigilance, trample, haste, protection from black and from red', "Flying, trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a creature other than Lord of the Pit. If you can't, Lord of the Pit deals 7 damage to you.", 'Flying, vigilance', "Flying, vigilance\\nWhen Twilight Shepherd comes into play, return to your hand all cards in your graveyard put there from play this turn.\\nPersist (When this creature is put into a graveyard from play, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to play under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying into play.', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to play.', "Flying\\nDaggerclaw Imp can't block.", "Flying\\nHellbent — Demon's Jester gets +2/+1 as long as you have no cards in hand.", 'Flying\\nSacrifice a creature: Fallen Angel gets +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Angel of Mercy comes into play, you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Foul Imp comes into play, you lose 2 life.', "Flying\\nWhen Reiver Demon comes into play, if you played it from your hand, destroy all nonartifact, nonblack creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Flying\\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Angelic Protector becomes the target of a spell or ability, Angelic Protector gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Stinkweed Imp deals combat damage to a creature, destroy that creature.\\nDredge 5 (If you would draw a card, instead you may put exactly five cards from the top of your library into your graveyard. If you do, return this card from your graveyard to your hand. Otherwise, draw a card.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever Sustainer of the Realm blocks, it gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a player plays a nonblack spell, that player loses 1 life.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Target player loses 1 life.', 'Marble Diamond comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} to your mana pool.', 'Pay 3 life: Put a +1/+1 counter on Souldrinker.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Remove target creature from the game. At end of turn, return that card to play under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.", 'Search your library for a card and put that card into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'Secluded Steppe comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} to your mana pool.\\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Spend only black mana on X.\\nConsume Spirit deals X damage to target creature or player and you gain X life.', 'Target opponent reveals his or her hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'W', 'When Abyssal Gatekeeper is put into a graveyard from play, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Venerable Monk comes into play, you gain 2 life.', 'Whenever Charging Paladin attacks, it gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature attacks, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a black spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a white spell, you may gain 1 life.', '{1}{W}{W}: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.']
